0,Usaghade language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Usaghade_language,"Language family. Niger–Congo?Usaghade, Isanguele or Isangele is a small Lower Cross River language spoken in the southwestern region of southern Cameroon, with some speakers across the border in Cross River State, Nigeria.",Usaghade,Niger-Congo
